title: Denial Intelligence › Appeal analysis report › Open and generate
route: /denials/D-3297/report
intro: Every denial has an appeal analysis report: seeded, added from a letter, or created on the Dashboard. The first time in a session the three agents put it together for a moment, then it opens. Reopening is instant until it is regenerated.
dir: TD
also: The report is built for any denial type. D-3297 is the paraphrased worked example and carries a 'Worked example' tag.
---
start s1 "Click 'Appeal analysis report' in the header card of a denial"
start s2 "Click 'Appeal analysis report' on the brief page"
start s3 "Click 'Appeal analysis report' at the top right of the brief page"
start s4 "Open /denials/D-xxxx/report by its address"
decision d1 "Does a request with that id exist?"
screen e1 "'We could not find that denial'\n'It may have been closed or the address is wrong.'"
click c0 "Click 'Back to Denial Intelligence'"
goto g0 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Ways in"
decision d2 "Was the report already generated for this denial in this session?"

screen sc1 "Crumbs: 'Denial Intelligence' › D-id › 'Appeal analysis report'\nPanel 'Generating appeal analysis'\n'D-id · initials, age · payer. A clinician reviews the report before anything is sent.'"
agent a1 "Reader is reading the letter and the chart, and removing identifiers"
agent a2 "Advocate is checking the notice, the deadline and how the payer applied its own criteria"
agent a3 "Historian is comparing N similar decisions and appeals"
wait w1 "About 2.5 seconds in all: one step per agent, each ticked off in turn\nWith reduced motion the spinner does not turn and the steps are quicker"
store st1 "Time of the report saved on the denial (this session only)"
screen sc2 "The report opens\nButtons: 'Copy report', 'Download PDF', 'Print', 'Regenerate'\nLink: 'Back to the denial'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Appeal analysis report › What the report says"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Appeal analysis report › Copy, PDF and print"

click c1 "Click 'Regenerate'"
store st2 "Saved time is cleared, so the panel runs again"
click c2 "Click 'Back to the denial'"
click c3 "Click the crumb 'Denial Intelligence' or the crumb with the D-id"
process p1 "Address opens /denials/D-xxxx (the crumb 'Denial Intelligence' opens the dashboard)"
goto g3 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened"
process p2 "Leave the page while it is generating: nothing is saved, the next visit generates again"
process p3 "Demo menu, 'Reset demo data' clears the saved times\nEvery report generates again"
end e2 "The person reads the report"

s1 --> d1
s2 --> d1
s3 --> d1
s4 --> d1
d1 -->|No| e1 --> c0 --> g0
d1 -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|No| sc1 --> a1 --> a2 --> a3 --> w1 --> st1 --> sc2
d2 -->|Yes, opens at once| sc2
sc1 -.-> p2
sc2 --> g1 & g2
sc2 --> e2
sc2 --> c1 --> st2 --> sc1
sc2 --> c2 --> p1 --> g3
sc2 --> c3 --> p1
sc2 -.-> p3
